blurb = "Depicts visitors walking through one of the caves of the [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ellora_Caves]Ellora Temple complex[/url], in Maharashtra, India.

The temple complex includes Hindu, Buddhist, and Jain rock-cut temples dating from the 7th to the 11th century.

This particular cave features a square hall, a central back shrine with a seated Buddha, and residential cells for monks."
